   "title": "Note",
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Keyframe in-betweening\nLoad two sprites of the **same size**: the first and the last pose of the move (make the end pose with workflow 04 *Edit*, e.g. 'make the knight crouch'). Describe the motion between them.\n**Combos:** run once per move and use the previous move's end pose as the next start pose; the frames line up exactly, so the GIFs/sheets can be concatenated (workflow 15 or any engine)."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
